cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Machine-learning analyses for blood-based lymphoma detection"
version: "1.0.0"
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python workflow for logistic-regression classification,
  nested stratified cross-validation, ROC analysis, confidence intervals,
  and threshold-based performance assessment for blood-based lymphoma
  detection. The repository includes only synthetic demonstration data and
  outputs; no patient-level study data are included.
authors:
